{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c50b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a07060-dc53-7421-8823-10572f5f580f"},"sequence":224,"recorded_at":1780531400000443,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"1bd0f4b7-3d42-45e7-aae9-47d49f725647","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"1bd0f4b7-3d42-45e7-aae9-47d49f725647","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"1bd0f4b7-3d42-45e7-aae9-47d49f725647"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"c60fde6f-fc22-413e-814a-b8274d0d8c84"},"task_id":"c60fde6f-fc22-413e-814a-b8274d0d8c84","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"c60fde6f-fc22-413e-814a-b8274d0d8c84","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-5-1\",\n  \"command\": \"grep -n \\\"provhost\\\\|internal/provider\\\" internal/traceability/ownership.v0.5.0.json | head -20; echo ---; python3 -c \\\"\\nimport json\\nd=json.load(open('internal/traceability/ownership.v0.5.0.json'))\\nprint('top keys:', list(d.keys()))\\nprint('ownership len:', len(d['ownership']))\\nfrom collections import Counter\\nprint(Counter(r['kind'] for r in d['ownership']))\\nprint('unowned:', d.get('unowned_sections'))\\n\\\" ; echo ---; grep -n \\\"canonical\\\\|Canonical\\\\|sha256\\\\|SHA256\\\" internal/traceability/traceability.go | head -30\",\n  \"description\": \"Survey ownership registry and hash computation\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"---\\ntop keys: ['format', 'format_version', 'source', 'acceptance_cases', 'ownership', 'unowned_sections']\\nownership len: 54\\nCounter({'section_binding': 49, 'normative_section': 2, 'fixture': 2, 'contract': 1})\\nunowned: [{'key': 'section:2.2', 'gap': 'Section 2.2 states the unconditional lease, replica, replication, tombstone and capability invariants of the product, and none of them is implemented here. The binding this entry replaces named validateSessionRecordCommon, which validates Session Record shape and the execution-profile enum value only.', 'evidence': 'The repository contains no lease, epoch, replica, takeover, tombstone or replication implementation: internal/canonicaljson validates record shape, internal/localstore stores immutable objects and rebuilds a local index, and the two acceptance cases the replaced binding named are canonical-identity cases.'}, {'key': 'section:18.4', 'gap': 'Section 18.4 requires audit retention - the exact Section 5.2 event types for lease change, force confirmation, managed replacement, task-board launch and adoption and tombstone issuance and resolution, and retention of the event and every referenced immutable object for as long as the Session Record. No retention, expiry or garbage-collection rule is implemented.', 'evidence': 'internal/localstore/projection.go opens, rebuilds and recovers the SQLite projection and installs immutable blobs; it declares no retention, expiry or garbage-collection behaviour, and the binding this entry replaces named OpenProjection with the same two storage acceptance cases already used by the Section 3.3 binding.'}]\\n---\\n9:\\t\\\"crypto/sha256\\\"\\n40:\\t// reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256 pins the semantic JSON projection. JSON\\n43:\\treviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256 = \\\"c70c86d24c7a1eddb538940f245396dad907b6aa60eaca92a6d5b1b09a647a12\\\"\\n109:\\tDocumentSHA256 string `json:\\\"document_sha256\\\"`\\n275:\\tif manifest.Source.Document.SHA256 != specpin.DocumentSHA256 {\\n278:\\t\\t\\tmanifest.Source.Document.SHA256, specpin.DocumentSHA256)\\n325:\\t\\tsource.DocumentSHA256 != manifest.Source.Document.SHA256 {\\n416:\\tcanonical, err := json.Marshal(registry)\\n418:\\t\\treturn Report{}, fail(\\\"encode canonical ownership registry: %v\\\", err)\\n420:\\tdigest := sha256.Sum256(canonical)\\n422:\\tif gotDigest != reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256 {\\n423:\\t\\treturn Report{}, fail(\\\"ownership registry projection digest %s differs from reviewed %s\\\", gotDigest, reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256)\\n628:\\t\\tcanonical := strings.ToLower(strings.Join(strings.Fields(scope), \\\"-\\\"))\\n629:\\t\\troot := canonical\\n630:\\t\\tidentifiers := []string{canonical}\\n631:\\t\\tif strings.HasPrefix(canonical, \\\"appendix-\\\") {\\n632:\\t\\t\\tif !specpin.IsSectionV050(canonical) {\\n640:\\t\\t\\tstart := canonicalNumericSection(matches[1])\\n643:\\t\\t\\t\\tend = canonicalNumericSection(matches[2])\\n719:\\t\\t\\tstart := canonicalNumericSection(strings.TrimSpace(parts[0]))\\n722:\\t\\t\\t\\tend = canonicalNumericSection(strings.TrimSpace(parts[1]))\\n763:func canonicalNumericSection(identifier string) string {\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2975,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 744,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
